        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 38,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "For my waist is filled with burning. There is no soundness in my flesh.",
      "ko": "내 허리에 열기가 가득하고 내 살에 성한 곳이 없나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "b59b08a675a0dda1bca39b64d56a059547ac85799b4f9eba1d7db860144671f3",
      "translation_text_hash": "97b6ea54ab3bce356e0f593365b30849ec89a228b2bfe59193c2d591b8b1a14f",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
