        {
          "book": "PSA",
          "chapter": 38,
          "verse": 8
        }
      ],
      "en": "I am faint and severely bruised. I have groaned by reason of the anguish of my heart.",
      "ko": "내가 피곤하고 심히 상하였으매 마음이 불안하여 신음하나이다",
      "source_text_hash": "126fbaddf69adfbd40eb31ae1a66bf53a9edd11cf82e1d9c4e6079cea7f64308",
      "translation_text_hash": "ba789507e8e092597422a68b8d6873f8f13aca890d566d379f686f2584747889",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "내가 피곤하고 심히 상하였으매 마음이 불안하여 신음하나이다"
      ],
